WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:25.558
Bear: I want to . . .

2
00:00:25.559 --> 00:00:28.808
Rabbit: Do you want to sing?

3
00:00:28.809 --> 00:00:40.615
Raccoon: I want to sing!

4
00:00:40.616 --> 00:01:07.224
Frog: I want to sing too!

5
00:01:07.225 --> 00:01:11.039
Bear: I do not want to sing.

6
00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.957
Bear: I want to . . .

7
00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:29.136
Frog: Do you want to dance?

8
00:01:29.137 --> 00:01:36.912
Rabbit: I want to dance.

9
00:01:36.913 --> 00:01:45.276
Raccoon: So do I!

10
00:01:45.277 --> 00:01:55.876
Bear: I do not want to dance.

11
00:01:55.877 --> 00:01:59.805
Rabbit: What do you want to do?

12
00:01:59.806 --> 00:02:38.373
Bear: I want to sleep!

